  "id": "the-naked-director-s01e06-scene-12",
  "pair": "ja-en",
  "title": "チョウチョウを標本にしてる  (Collecting Butterflies)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "fujiwara": "藤原",
    "police": "警察官",
    "takei": "武井"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Inside the raided copying warehouse, the angry manager demands to know why police aren't going after bigger syndicates, and Detective Takei answers with an eerie story about his butterfly collection. Let's listen in Japanese first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "fujiwara",
      "t": "うちよりももっとでけえとこ潰せよ！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "takei",
      "t": "お前、標本って分かる？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "fujiwara",
      "t": "標本？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "takei",
      "t": "俺はチョウチョウを標本にしてるんだよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "fujiwara",
      "t": "何言ってるんだ、お前？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "takei",
      "t": "サナギの状態でも、こいつはでかくなるなってのが分かるようになる。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "takei",
      "t": "だから、チョウチョウが一番大きくなるのを待って、そこから俺は標本にしてるんだよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "fujiwara",
      "t": "さっきから何意味の分かんねえこと言ってるんだ？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "takei",
      "t": "相手がでかくねえと、俺の手柄が小さくなるだろ？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "takei",
      "t": "お前らはもうこれ以上でかくなんねえから、終わりってことで。お疲れさん。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "police",
      "t": "おとなしくしろ！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "takei",
      "t": "まだ羽があるなら、ほら、逃げてみろよ。空へ飛んでけ！",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "fujiwara",
      "t": "うちよりももっとでけえとこ潰せよ！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Go shut down outfits way bigger than ours!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "takei",
      "t": "お前、標本って分かる？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Hey, do you know what specimen collecting is?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "fujiwara",
      "t": "標本？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Specimen collecting?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "takei",
      "t": "俺はチョウチョウを標本にしてるんだよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I mount butterflies as specimens, you see.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "fujiwara",
      "t": "何言ってるんだ、お前？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What on earth are you talking about?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "takei",
      "t": "サナギの状態でも、こいつはでかくなるなってのが分かるようになる。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Even in the pupa stage, you learn to tell which ones are going to grow big.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "takei",
      "t": "だから、チョウチョウが一番大きくなるのを待って、そこから俺は標本にしてるんだよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'So I wait until a butterfly grows to its biggest size, and then I mount it.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "fujiwara",
      "t": "さっきから何意味の分かんねえこと言ってるんだ？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Why have you been spouting nonsense this whole time?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "takei",
      "t": "相手がでかくねえと、俺の手柄が小さくなるだろ？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Unless the target is big, my own credit shrinks, doesn't it?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "takei",
      "t": "お前らはもうこれ以上でかくなんねえから、終わりってことで。お疲れさん。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You guys aren't getting any bigger than this, so it's curtains for you. Good work.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "police",
      "t": "おとなしくしろ！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Pipe down and behave!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "takei",
      "t": "まだ羽があるなら、ほら、逃げてみろよ。空へ飛んでけ！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'If you've still got wings, go on, try escaping. Fly off into the sky!'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
